# CODEOWNERS — the files whose change IS the review.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS, and why it is being created rather than assumed. Two modules in this
# repository describe themselves as CODEOWNERS-protected:
#
#   src/lib/agents/authority/types.ts:101 — "The whole lock file (CODEOWNERS-protected; changing it
#                                            is a security review)"
#   src/lib/agents/adl/README.md:30       — "Put it under CODEOWNERS."
#
# There was no CODEOWNERS file. The authority lock's protection was a comment asserting a control
# that did not exist, which in this programme's terms is a defect in its own right — and the §92.210
# fairness lock added in W7.5d was about to inherit the same claim by copying the sentence.
#
# The two locks below are the same KIND of object: a separate, reviewed record that an artifact may
# only narrow against, whose value comes entirely from someone other than the artifact's author
# having looked at it. A lock any contributor can edit alongside the thing it governs is a form.
#
# NOTE ON FORCE: a CODEOWNERS file only binds where the host enforces required reviews on protected
# branches. It is a declaration of who must look, not a mechanism that stops an edit. The mechanical
# half lives in the gates — `adl:check` (byte-identity), `check:92210` (identification by
# construction, orphan-refusing), `check:revqual`. Neither half is sufficient alone, and neither
# should be described as if it were.

# ── The authority lock: what each agent is permitted to BE ───────────────────────────────────────
# Changing a ceiling here widens what an agent may do, at build time and at load time.
/src/lib/agents/authority/data/authority-lock.json   @security-review @platform-owners

# ── The §92.210 fairness lock: what each input MEASURES, and what was done about it ──────────────
# Every entry is a statement a named human made on a date about whether an input variable measures
# race, color, national origin, sex, age or disability — and what mitigates the resulting risk.
# Adding an entry to silence a gate, without doing the review, is the failure its separateness
# exists to make visible.
/src/lib/fairness/data/fairness-lock.json            @section-1557-coordinator @platform-owners

# ── The agent definitions and their compiled manifest ────────────────────────────────────────────
/src/lib/agents/adl/data/                            @platform-owners
/src/lib/agents/manifest/data/                       @platform-owners

# ── The quality ratchet and the provenance record ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/quality-baseline.json                               @platform-owners
/docs/build-provenance/                              @platform-owners
